# Backend JSON data store + uploaded media (server/store.cjs) -- this is
# runtime data, not source. On Render, point DATA_DIR at a persistent Disk
# instead of relying on this being committed. NOTE: the root-level
# bookings.json is intentionally NOT ignored -- it's the legacy seed file
# that email-server.cjs migrates into data/bookings.json on first boot.
/data/
/data_test/
/uploads/

